# INVWINSO.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: several items
# selected at level 1 (READER).  CTRL-D, DEL and CTRL-L on three items
# each show INV's refusal once, in one message box, and nothing after
# it.
# The end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINSO.SNP is its snapshot;
# TEST/selchk.py checks it.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN
S THREE
K CTRL-D
S NODUP
K ENTER
S NODUPBK
K DEL
S NODEL
K ENTER
S NODELBK
K CTRL-L
S NOLEND
K ENTER
S NOLENDBK
K ALT-F X
